 "aboutMe": {
  "title": "Hi, This is Arnob",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "I am a veterinary student at Habiganj Agricultural University with a strong academic record and a keen interest in zoonotic disease control, especially rabies and related public health problems. I serve as President of the Animal Rescue & Welfare Association (CARE) at HAU, and I am building my skills in research methodology, data interpretation and international academic communication. I am also curious about quality control systems and modern laboratory and diagnostic technologies. My goal is to pursue higher studies and research abroad, with long-term plans in veterinary public health and evidence-based practice.",
